  "title": "· New Bag | Balenciaga Debuts the Winter 26 Hourglass Avenue: An Hourglass Silhouette with a Brass Square Buckle ·",
  "original_title": "新包 | Balenciaga 发售冬季26新款 Hourglass Avenue 手袋：沙漏廓形，黄铜方扣",
  "excerpt": "Balenciaga launches the Hourglass Avenue bag this week, blending its signature hourglass shape with vintage doctor-bag style in glossy calfskin.",
  "author": "撰稿 X Vivi 编辑 X RAN",
  "date_iso": "2026-09-16",
  "date_label": "September 16, 2026",
  "cover_image": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/2n7ebw8/2c4fd2565ca63d3d.jpg",
