    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Balenciaga's Winter 26 runway debut, the Hourglass Avenue bag, officially launches this week. Drawing on the house's signature hourglass silhouette and vintage doctor-bag codes, the new design features a lustrous Box calfskin body accented with a minimalist brass clasp. Its fluid, curved base echoes the cinched waist of a corset, carrying forward the classic tailoring of Balenciaga's early haute couture.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
