    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Hourglass Avenue is the latest addition to the Hourglass family, continuing the line's signature hourglass shape inspired by founder Cristóbal Balenciaga's Basque waist. The bag takes its flap structure from the classic doctor's bag and is crafted from specially treated Box calfskin, retaining a structured shape without sacrificing a supple feel.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Enlarged view — click to zoom in for an ultra-clear visual experience",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The flap is fastened with a minimalist brass clasp engraved with the BALENCIAGA logo and the words 10 Avenue George V, a nod to the house's haute couture atelier at 10 Avenue George V in Paris.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
