    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Currently available in two sizes, small and medium, the bag comes with a top handle, a concealed second handle, and an adjustable, detachable long shoulder strap, allowing it to be carried by hand, on the shoulder, or crossbody. Lined in soft nappa lambskin, it features a single large compartment, an interior zip pocket, and a back pocket. The short flap can be closed or tucked inside the body, letting you switch between multiple styling options.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
