    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The small size comes in four colorways: black, grape purple, white, and carmine red. The black-and-gold pairing is a classic, versatile choice; the raisin hue is understated yet distinctive; the white is clean and elegant; and the red is eye-catching and full of presence. The glossy Box calfskin has an oil-paint-like sheen that makes the bag feel like a fine sculptural work of art.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
